MODULE: ResolvedReusedIdSuppressed
TARGET: CheckpointSafe
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Carry the bare resolved TxId across physical logs and checkpoint the suppressed new transaction
PERTURBS: EnterTail

--- FIND
    /\ resolved' = IF candidate = tail THEN resolved ELSE FALSE
    /\ order' = IF candidate = tail THEN order ELSE <<>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ resolved' = resolved
    /\ order' = order
--- END
